# Netlify Redirects Configuration for WildlifeVision AI
# Directs /api/* requests to Netlify Serverless Functions before SPA catch-all

/api/analyze-animal    /.netlify/functions/analyze-animal    200!
/api/analyze-image     /.netlify/functions/analyze-animal    200!
/api/image-analyze     /.netlify/functions/analyze-animal    200!
/api/analyze-video     /.netlify/functions/analyze-video     200!
/api/video-analyze     /.netlify/functions/analyze-video     200!
/api/analyze           /.netlify/functions/analyze-universal 200!
/api/config            /.netlify/functions/config            200!
/api/history/clear     /.netlify/functions/history           200!
/api/history/*         /.netlify/functions/history           200!
/api/history           /.netlify/functions/history           200!
/api/*                 /.netlify/functions/:splat            200!
/*                     /index.html                           200
